  "description": "Record Platform cold-bootstrap DAG (acyclic). Acceptance nodes H.kafka_identity_canary / I.kafka_three_broker_acceptance are gated (RP_GATE5_V7_ACCEPTANCE=1) and not executed by default cold-bootstrap.",
